# Production env for the web deploy (web/scripts/deploy.sh sources .env.prod).
# Values marked gitslice-secret: are Gitslice secrets of gitslice/gitslice. The
# account's owners and admins fill them with:
#
#   gs secret env env.prod.template --slice gitslice/gitslice -o .env.prod
#
# The other values are public. .env.prod is gitignored; never commit it.

